  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung looks at his sons, seeing their youth and fitness.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son appears flushed and uneasy.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We are setting up a great store and we will make a great deal of money out of it.\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We will sell out the good land you have there and we will buy more and we will have enough to last us our lives.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son gestures to his wife with a mixture of pride and desperation.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son follows his brother's example.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Why, we will sell the good land?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son gestures to his wife again.",
  "the eldest son (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and for the sake of my eldest son and his wife. They have a small place and it is too small for them,\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung asks why they cannot put the child in the school.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Why cannot you put the child in the school? It is a good school in the town and it is not expensive.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"There is no need to put it in the school. It is too young to learn anything anyway.\"",
